yard — ~3.25 ha at up to ~70% grade above Bernkastel","si":"wine","blurb":"walk up the world''s most famous and costly Riesling vineyard — ~3.25 ha at up to ~70% grade above Bernkastel","when":"walks best May-Oct; tastings year-round, verify","commission":"operator/winery 10-15%"},{"name":"The Middle Mosel Wine Festival, Bernkastel-Kues","si_tag":"Wine & Spirits","status":"future","tier":"comfort","price_band":"hotel-led ~EUR 150-400/night (approx)","timing":"~3-7 Sep 2026 — book by spring","draw_rank":3,"hook":"the valley''s largest harvest festival — the medieval Marktplatz becomes an open-air wine bar with 40+ Riesling growers pouring, a wine-queen coronation","si":"wine","blurb":"the valley''s largest harvest festival — the medieval Marktplatz becomes an open-air wine bar with 40+ Riesling growers pouring, a wine-queen coronation","when":"~3-7 Sep 2026 — book by spring","commission":"consortia/host on stay"},{"name":"A Mosel river cruise (day or multi-day)","si_tag":"River Cruises","status":"live","tier":"essential","price_band":"day ~EUR 14-40/pp; multi-day premier-ultra","timing":"day boats ~May-Oct; multi-day ~Apr-Oct + Dec, book year prior","draw_rank":1,"hook":"the vineyard slopes, hairpin bends and castle towns unfold from the deck","si":"river","blurb":"the vineyard slopes, hairpin bends and castle towns unfold from the deck","when":"day boats ~May-Oct; multi-day ~Apr-Oct + Dec, book year prior","commission":"day-boat bundle / cruise-line 10-20% (CLIA)"},{"name":"Reichsburg Cochem guided tour","si_tag":"Culture & Heritage","status":"future","tier":"essential","price_band":"~EUR 5-9/pp (approx)","timing":"tours ~Mar-Nov, ~09:00-17:00 — verify","draw_rank":1,"hook":"the turreted neo-Gothic castle over Cochem — first built ~1000, razed by French troops in 1689, rebuilt from 1868","si":"culture","blurb":"the turreted neo-Gothic castle over Cochem — first built ~1000, razed by French troops in 1689, rebuilt from 1868","when":"tours ~Mar-Nov, ~09:00-17:00 — ver